{"id":27757,"slug":"zero-de-conduite","title":"Zéro de conduite","year":1933,"country":"France","duration":44,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/27757-zero-de-conduite","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/0ded2e6694829cdb2e39239358edaa76/NrStq4zs8cYaZcEI7cT84oirhhJHqd_large.jpg","description":"So effervescent and charming that one can easily forget its importance in film history, Jean Vigo’s enormously influential portrait of prankish boarding-school students is one of cinema’s great acts of rebellion. Based on the director’s own experiences as a youth, Zéro de conduite presents childhood as a time of unfettered imagination and brazen rule-flouting. It’s a sweet-natured vision of sabotage made vivid by dynamic visual experiments—including the famous, blissful slow-motion pillow fight.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Jean Vigo","slug":"jean-vigo"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Jean Dasté","role":"Huguet","slug":"jean-daste"},{"actor":"Robert Le Flon","role":"Perrain (Old Tightass)","slug":"robert-le-flon"},{"actor":"Blanchar, a.k.a. Du Verron","role":"General supervisor (Beanpole)","slug":"blanchar-a-k-a-du-verron"},{"actor":"Delphin","role":"Headmaster","slug":"delphin"},{"actor":"Léon Larive","role":"M. Viot","slug":"leon-larive"},{"actor":"Madame Émile","role":"Ma Beans","slug":"madame-emile"},{"actor":"Louis de Gonzague-Frick","role":"Government prefect","slug":"louis-de-gonzague-frick"},{"actor":"Louis Lefebvre","role":"Caussat","slug":"louis-lefebvre"},{"actor":"Gilbert Pruchon","role":"Colin","slug":"gilbert-pruchon"},{"actor":"Coco Golstein/Constantin Kelber","role":"Bruel","slug":"coco-golstein-constantin-kelber"},{"actor":"Gérard de Bédarieux","role":"Tabard","slug":"gerard-de-bedarieux"},{"actor":"Louis Berger","role":"Guardian","slug":"louis-berger"},{"actor":"Henri Storck","role":"Priest","slug":"henri-storck"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Jean Vigo","slug":"jean-vigo"},{"role":"Screenplay","person